# The decisions: sequence numbering and routing, discarding bodies nobody will read, how a
# connection's end reaches pending calls, encoding the argument before the header, Go's exact
# dispatch errors, and the server waiting for in-flight calls. The CONTROL- lines must SURVIVE.

